{"title":"Career Roadmap · Embassy Roles","role":"Embassy Roles","summary":"An Embassy Roles pathway prepares students for language-enabled administrative, translation, interpretation, cultural, consular-support, public-diplomacy, research, and international-relations positions associated with embassies, consulates, diplomatic missions, international organisations, and organisations serving international clients.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"BA (General / Honours) — Translation & Interpretation"},"about":[{"label":"Language options","text":"German / French / Japanese / Korean / Chinese / Arabic"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Language/translation intern, multilingual support associate, translation assistant, international-office assistant"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Translator, interpreter, embassy/consular support professional, international programme associate"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior Translator/Interpreter, Consular Specialist, Protocol Specialist, International Affairs Specialist"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Senior diplomatic-support professional, language-services manager, international programme lead, senior interpreter or country specialist"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Embassy Roles pathway prepares students for language-enabled administrative, translation, interpretation, cultural, consular-support, public-diplomacy, research, and international-relations positions associated with embassies, consulates, diplomatic missions, international organisations, and organisations serving international clients."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA specialising in Translation & Interpretation provides a strong foundation, particularly when combined with high foreign-language proficiency, English, translation technology, cross-cultural communication, diplomacy, documentation, protocol, and international affairs."},{"type":"note","label":"Important career distinction","text":"“Embassy Roles” is a broad career category, not one standardized government job title. Foreign Service/diplomatic officer positions, locally hired embassy staff, translators/interpreters, consular support employees, and administrative staff have different recruitment systems and eligibility rules."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Strong alignment for language-enabled embassy and international-services roles."},{"type":"p","text":"The student should not rely on the BA alone. A competitive profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Foreign Language","English","Translation/Interpretation","International Affairs","Protocol","Documentation","Digital Tools","Cross-cultural Communication"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For an Indian student targeting the Indian Foreign Service, the embassy-role pathway is different: IFS is a civil-service career recruited through the applicable UPSC Civil Services process."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Exact progression depends on employer, country, nationality, language level, security requirements and recruitment route."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Foreign language fundamentals + English"},{"text":"University + language resources"},{"text":"A1/A2 proficiency evidence"},{"text":"Language"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Translation fundamentals"},{"text":"Translation exercises"},{"text":"20 translated passages"},{"text":"Translation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced grammar + vocabulary"},{"text":"Formal language study"},{"text":"B1-level work"},{"text":"Language proficiency"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"International affairs"},{"text":"IR/diplomacy courses"},{"text":"Country briefing"},{"text":"Domain knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Interpretation"},{"text":"Consecutive/simultaneous practice"},{"text":"Recorded interpretation portfolio"},{"text":"Interpretation"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Embassy/NGO/international internship"},{"text":"Diplomatic/international organisations"},{"text":"Internship + supervisor assessment"},{"text":"Workplace readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Specialised translation"},{"text":"Legal/business/consular material"},{"text":"Specialised translation portfolio"},{"text":"Professional capability"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Job preparation"},{"text":"Embassy/international vacancies"},{"text":"Language certificate + CV + portfolio"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Foreign-language mastery"},{"type":"p","text":"The most important variable in this career is actual language proficiency, not simply having studied the language as a degree subject."},{"type":"h","text":"Target"},{"type":"flow","items":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"]},{"type":"p","text":"For professional translation and interpretation, aim for B2/C1 or higher, depending on the role and language."},{"type":"h","text":"Language-specific routes"},{"type":"table","header":["Language","Useful proficiency pathway"],"rows":[[{"text":"French"},{"text":"A1 → A2 → B1 → B2 → C1; consider DELF/DALF"}],[{"text":"German"},{"text":"A1 → A2 → B1 → B2 → C1; consider Goethe examinations"}],[{"text":"Japanese"},{"text":"A1-equivalent → intermediate → advanced; JLPT can provide formal evidence"}],[{"text":"Korean"},{"text":"Beginner → intermediate → advanced; TOPIK can provide formal evidence"}],[{"text":"Chinese/Mandarin"},{"text":"Beginner → intermediate → advanced; HSK can provide formal evidence"}],[{"text":"Arabic"},{"text":"Formal Arabic + practical communication + specialised vocabulary"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Certification frameworks and examination requirements should be checked with the relevant official examination body."},{"type":"h","text":"Translation skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Source-text analysis"},{"text":"Target-language accuracy"},{"text":"Terminology"},{"text":"Context"},{"text":"Tone"},{"text":"Register"},{"text":"Cultural adaptation"},{"text":"Proofreading"},{"text":"Revision"},{"text":"Quality assurance"},{"text":"Translation memory"},{"text":"Terminology management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Translation directions"},{"type":"h","text":"Practise:"},{"type":"h","text":"Foreign Language → English"},{"type":"h","text":"English → Foreign Language"},{"type":"p","text":"Where professionally appropriate, develop translation between your strongest working languages rather than assuming equal proficiency in both directions."},{"type":"h","text":"Embassy-specific translation"},{"type":"h","text":"Practise translating:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Official correspondence"},{"text":"Invitations"},{"text":"Diplomatic notes"},{"text":"Press releases"},{"text":"Public notices"},{"text":"Programme information"},{"text":"Event materials"},{"text":"Speeches"},{"text":"Travel information"},{"text":"Cultural content"},{"text":"Government communications"},{"text":"Business documents"},{"text":"International agreements at a non-legal training level"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid presenting student work as legally authoritative translation."},{"type":"h","text":"Interpretation"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn the difference between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Consecutive interpretation"},{"type":"flow","items":["Speaker","pause","interpreter","audience"]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Meetings"},{"text":"Delegations"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Site visits"},{"text":"Small diplomatic meetings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Simultaneous interpretation"},{"type":"h","text":"Speaker → interpreter listens and speaks almost simultaneously"},{"type":"h","text":"Used in settings such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conferences"},{"text":"Large international meetings"},{"text":"Multilateral events"},{"text":"High-level diplomatic forums"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This requires substantially more advanced training and practice."},{"type":"h","text":"Interpretation skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Note-taking"},{"text":"Memory"},{"text":"Public speaking"},{"text":"Terminology recall"},{"text":"Concentration"},{"text":"Rapid comprehension"},{"text":"Neutrality"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Stress management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"International-affairs knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"A language professional working around diplomacy should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International relations"},{"text":"Foreign policy"},{"text":"Diplomacy"},{"text":"Geopolitics"},{"text":"International organisations"},{"text":"International law fundamentals"},{"text":"International trade"},{"text":"Migration"},{"text":"Security"},{"text":"Regional politics"},{"text":"Bilateral relations"},{"text":"Multilateral diplomacy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Ministry of External Affairs, Government of India","url":"https://www.mea.gov.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Consular knowledge"},{"type":"h","text":"Build awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passport/travel documentation"},{"text":"Visa processes"},{"text":"Consular appointments"},{"text":"Citizen assistance"},{"text":"Document verification"},{"text":"Attestation/legalisation concepts"},{"text":"Emergency assistance"},{"text":"Overseas citizen services"},{"text":"Confidential records"},{"text":"Data protection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A support employee should not assume authority to make visa, immigration or consular decisions. Those powers depend on the relevant government and role."},{"type":"h","text":"Protocol and diplomatic etiquette"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Official greetings"},{"text":"Seating arrangements"},{"text":"Formal introductions"},{"text":"Flag protocol"},{"text":"Titles and forms of address"},{"text":"Delegation management"},{"text":"Meeting etiquette"},{"text":"Diplomatic correspondence"},{"text":"Official event coordination"},{"text":"Cultural sensitivity"},{"text":"Confidentiality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Word"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"PDF/document management"},{"text":"Email/calendar management"},{"text":"CAT tools"},{"text":"Translation memory"},{"text":"Terminology databases"},{"text":"Subtitle/transcription tools"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Basic CMS"},{"text":"AI-assisted translation QA"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CAT tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation memory"},{"text":"Terminology database"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Alignment"},{"text":"Quality assurance"},{"text":"Machine translation post-editing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI and machine translation can accelerate workflows, but professional translators must verify meaning, terminology, cultural context and sensitive information."},{"type":"h","text":"High-value projects during the BA"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Diplomatic Translation Portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"Create 20–30 samples covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Formal correspondence"},{"text":"Press releases"},{"text":"Event invitations"},{"text":"Public notices"},{"text":"Country profiles"},{"text":"Cultural articles"},{"text":"International news"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Show:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Source","Translation","Terminology notes","Final revision"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Country Desk"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a country associated with your language."},{"type":"h","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Political system"},{"text":"Economy"},{"text":"Foreign policy"},{"text":"India relations"},{"text":"Major diplomatic developments"},{"text":"Trade"},{"text":"Culture"},{"text":"Language"},{"text":"International organisations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Update it every month."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Mock Consular Helpdesk"},{"type":"h","text":"Build a simulated workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Applicant","Query","Document checklist","Language support","Case routing","Response","Escalation"]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates administrative and communication skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Interpretation Portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"Record yourself interpreting:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News clips"},{"text":"Speeches"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Short meetings"},{"text":"Conference excerpts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Terminology"},{"text":"Delivery"},{"text":"Missing information"},{"text":"Timing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — International Event"},{"type":"p","text":"Organise a simulated diplomatic/international event."},{"type":"h","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Invitation"},{"text":"Guest list"},{"text":"Agenda"},{"text":"Seating plan"},{"text":"Protocol checklist"},{"text":"Bilingual communication"},{"text":"Event briefing"},{"text":"Post-event report"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — AI Translation QA"},{"type":"h","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Human translation","Machine translation","AI-assisted revision","Human final QA"]},{"type":"h","text":"Document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Terminology errors"},{"text":"Context errors"},{"text":"Cultural errors"},{"text":"Missing meaning"},{"text":"Hallucinated content"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This becomes a strong future-oriented portfolio project."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Diplomatic Translation"},{"text":"Language + translation + diplomacy"},{"text":"Senior Diplomatic Translator"}],[{"text":"Interpretation"},{"text":"Language + consecutive/simultaneous interpretation"},{"text":"Senior Interpreter"}],[{"text":"Consular Services"},{"text":"Language + documentation + citizen services"},{"text":"Consular Services Specialist"}],[{"text":"Protocol"},{"text":"Language + protocol + events"},{"text":"Protocol Specialist"}],[{"text":"International Affairs"},{"text":"Language + IR + research"},{"text":"International Affairs Specialist"}],[{"text":"Public Diplomacy"},{"text":"Language + communication + media"},{"text":"Public Diplomacy Specialist"}],[{"text":"Cultural Relations"},{"text":"Language + culture + events"},{"text":"Cultural Relations Officer/Specialist"}],[{"text":"International Organisations"},{"text":"Language + development + policy"},{"text":"International Programme Specialist"}],[{"text":"Translation Technology"},{"text":"Language + CAT + AI"},{"text":"Language Technology Specialist"}],[{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Language + digital content + QA"},{"text":"Localization Specialist"}],[{"text":"Legal/Business Translation"},{"text":"Language + specialised terminology"},{"text":"Legal/Business Translator"}],[{"text":"International Customer Support"},{"text":"Language + CRM + communication"},{"text":"Multilingual Support Lead"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / diplomatic ecosystem"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / ecosystem","Relevant exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"Ministry of External Affairs"},{"text":"Diplomacy, international affairs and language-related exposure"}],[{"text":"Indian Council for Cultural Relations"},{"text":"Cultural diplomacy and international exchange"}],[{"text":"Embassies and Consulates"},{"text":"Locally advertised support, cultural, administrative or language roles"}],[{"text":"Central Translation Bureau"},{"text":"Government translation exposure"}],[{"text":"Department of Official Language"},{"text":"Language policy and translation"}],[{"text":"Central Hindi Training Institute"},{"text":"Language/translation ecosystem"}],[{"text":"Ministry of Commerce & Industry"},{"text":"International trade"}],[{"text":"ICCR international programmes"},{"text":"Cultural relations"}],[{"text":"Universities' international offices"},{"text":"International student/exchange administration"}],[{"text":"International research organisations"},{"text":"Country and language research"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Indian Council for Cultural Relations","url":"https://www.iccr.gov.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Department of Official Language","url":"https://rajbhasha.gov.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Central Translation Bureau","url":"https://ctb.rajbhasha.gov.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Private / international-sector internships"},{"type":"h","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation agencies"},{"text":"Localization companies"},{"text":"International BPO/KPOs"},{"text":"Global consulting firms"},{"text":"International NGOs"},{"text":"International education companies"},{"text":"Global mobility organisations"},{"text":"Visa-support organisations"},{"text":"International conference companies"},{"text":"Multinational companies"},{"text":"Travel companies"},{"text":"International media organisations"},{"text":"Language technology companies"},{"text":"AI language-data companies"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Internship priority","text":"select roles that provide actual translation, interpretation, international client communication, documentation or language QA experience."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning area","Why it helps"],"rows":[[{"text":"Official foreign-language proficiency certification"},{"text":"Demonstrates language level"}],[{"text":"Translation Studies"},{"text":"Professional translation"}],[{"text":"Interpretation training"},{"text":"Interpreting skills"}],[{"text":"Diplomatic protocol"},{"text":"Embassy readiness"}],[{"text":"International Relations"},{"text":"Domain knowledge"}],[{"text":"CAT tools"},{"text":"Translation technology"}],[{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Global digital content"}],[{"text":"Subtitling/transcription"},{"text":"Media language work"}],[{"text":"Proofreading/editing"},{"text":"Translation QA"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"International programme work"}],[{"text":"Excel/Power BI"},{"text":"Administrative/reporting roles"}],[{"text":"AI-assisted translation QA"},{"text":"Future language workflows"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For the language itself, consider the relevant official examination system—for example DELF/DALF, Goethe examinations, JLPT, TOPIK or HSK, depending on the selected language."},{"type":"p","text":"Do not treat a language certificate as proof of professional interpretation ability; those are related but distinct competencies."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Realistic first-job titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation Assistant"},{"text":"Junior Translator"},{"text":"Language Assistant"},{"text":"Multilingual Support Executive"},{"text":"International Relations Assistant"},{"text":"International Office Assistant"},{"text":"Consular Support Assistant"},{"text":"Embassy Support Executive"},{"text":"Diplomatic Support Assistant"},{"text":"Protocol Assistant"},{"text":"International Programme Assistant"},{"text":"Cultural Relations Assistant"},{"text":"Public Diplomacy Assistant"},{"text":"Interpretation Assistant"},{"text":"Junior Interpreter"},{"text":"Conference Interpreter Trainee"},{"text":"Localization Executive"},{"text":"Language Quality Analyst"},{"text":"Translation QA Associate"},{"text":"Multilingual Content Executive"},{"text":"International Client Support Associate"},{"text":"Country Research Assistant"},{"text":"International Affairs Research Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Role-to-skill mapping"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Translation Assistant"},{"text":"Language + translation"},{"text":"Translation portfolio"}],[{"text":"Junior Translator"},{"text":"B2/C1+ language + QA"},{"text":"Certified language + samples"}],[{"text":"Interpreter Trainee"},{"text":"Listening + speaking + interpretation"},{"text":"Recorded interpretation"}],[{"text":"Embassy Support Assistant"},{"text":"Language + administration"},{"text":"Mock consular workflow"}],[{"text":"Protocol Assistant"},{"text":"Language + protocol"},{"text":"International event"}],[{"text":"Cultural Relations Assistant"},{"text":"Language + culture"},{"text":"Cultural programme project"}],[{"text":"Localization Executive"},{"text":"Language + digital QA"},{"text":"Localization samples"}],[{"text":"Language QA Associate"},{"text":"Language + attention to detail"},{"text":"QA portfolio"}],[{"text":"International Affairs Assistant"},{"text":"Language + IR"},{"text":"Country desk"}],[{"text":"Consular Support Assistant"},{"text":"Language + documentation"},{"text":"Consular simulation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"There is no single universal “Embassy Roles” recruitment pathway."},{"type":"h","text":"Potential routes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Locally hired embassy/consulate staff"},{"text":"Government diplomatic/foreign-service route"},{"text":"International organisation route"},{"text":"Translation/interpreting route"},{"text":"Private international-services route"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Eligibility can depend on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Citizenship"},{"text":"Language proficiency"},{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Work experience"},{"text":"Security/background checks"},{"text":"Local employment rules"},{"text":"Employer-specific requirements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Always read the individual vacancy."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG option","Best for"],"rows":[[{"text":"MA Translation Studies"},{"text":"Professional translation"}],[{"text":"MA Interpretation Studies"},{"text":"Interpretation"}],[{"text":"MA Foreign Language"},{"text":"Advanced language expertise"}],[{"text":"MA International Relations"},{"text":"Diplomacy"}],[{"text":"MA International Studies"},{"text":"International affairs"}],[{"text":"MA Diplomacy"},{"text":"Diplomatic studies where available"}],[{"text":"MA Linguistics"},{"text":"Language research"}],[{"text":"MA Applied Linguistics"},{"text":"Professional language work"}],[{"text":"MA International Business"},{"text":"Global business"}],[{"text":"MA Public Policy"},{"text":"Government/international policy"}],[{"text":"MA International Law"},{"text":"Legal-diplomatic pathway, subject to eligibility"}],[{"text":"MBA International Business"},{"text":"Corporate international roles"}],[{"text":"MA Area Studies"},{"text":"Country/region specialisation"}],[{"text":"PhD Translation Studies"},{"text":"Academic/research career"}],[{"text":"PhD Linguistics"},{"text":"Language research"}],[{"text":"PhD International Relations"},{"text":"Diplomatic/international research"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong combinations"},{"type":"h","text":"Language + Translation Studies"},{"type":"h","text":"Language + International Relations"},{"type":"h","text":"Language + International Law"},{"type":"h","text":"Language + Public Policy"},{"type":"h","text":"Language + Area Studies"},{"type":"h","text":"Language + AI/NLP"}]},{"heading":"Study abroad, country by country","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Example universities / ecosystem","Scholarship route","Gate to check"],"rows":[[{"text":"France"},{"text":"Sciences Po and French language/translation institutions"},{"text":"French/institutional scholarships"},{"text":"French proficiency"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Universities and translation/linguistics programmes"},{"text":"DAAD"},{"text":"German/English programme requirements"}],[{"text":"Japan"},{"text":"Universities with Japanese studies, translation and international studies"},{"text":"MEXT"},{"text":"Academic + language requirements"}],[{"text":"South Korea"},{"text":"Korean studies and international-relations programmes"},{"text":"GKS"},{"text":"Academic + Korean/English requirements"}],[{"text":"China"},{"text":"Universities with Chinese language and international studies"},{"text":"Chinese Government Scholarship"},{"text":"Programme and language requirements"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Universities offering translation, interpreting and IR programmes"},{"text":"Chevening + university funding"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites"}],[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Universities with translation, interpreting and international-affairs programmes"},{"text":"Fulbright + university funding"},{"text":"Academic + language requirements"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Universities offering translation/linguistics/international studies"},{"text":"University funding"},{"text":"Admission requirements"}],[{"text":"Switzerland"},{"text":"Geneva-based international and language ecosystem"},{"text":"Institutional funding"},{"text":"Highly competitive admission"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"DAAD India","url":"https://www.daad.in/en/"},{"type":"p","text":"USIEF / Fulbright-Nehru","url":"https://www.usief.org.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Application portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Language proficiency certificate"},{"text":"Academic transcript"},{"text":"Translation portfolio"},{"text":"Interpretation recordings"},{"text":"Research paper"},{"text":"Country-study portfolio"},{"text":"Internship certificates"},{"text":"Statement of Purpose"},{"text":"Recommendation letters"},{"text":"English-language test where required"},{"text":"Language test where required"}]}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Student","Language/Translation Intern","Translation/International Support Assistant","Translator/Interpreter/Embassy Support Executive","Senior Translator/Interpreter/International Affairs Specialist","Language/Consular/Protocol Specialist","Manager/Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"Diplomatic route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA","UPSC CSE preparation","Civil Services Examination","Indian Foreign Service, if selected and allocated","Diplomatic postings"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is not the same route as being hired locally by an embassy."},{"type":"h","text":"Translation route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA","Translation Intern","Junior Translator","Translator","Senior Translator","Translation Lead/Language Services Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Interpretation route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA","Interpretation Trainee","Junior Interpreter","Professional Interpreter","Senior/Conference Interpreter","Interpretation Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD routes"},{"type":"h","text":"Possible doctoral directions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation Studies"},{"text":"Interpretation Studies"},{"text":"Linguistics"},{"text":"Applied Linguistics"},{"text":"Foreign Language Studies"},{"text":"International Relations"},{"text":"Diplomacy"},{"text":"Area Studies"},{"text":"International Communication"},{"text":"Comparative Literature"},{"text":"International Law"},{"text":"Language Technology"},{"text":"Computational Linguistics"},{"text":"Machine Translation"},{"text":"Multilingual AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"Language professionals will increasingly work alongside machine translation, speech recognition, AI interpretation and multilingual language models."},{"type":"p","text":"Routine translation is likely to become increasingly automated. The strongest long-term professionals will therefore develop expertise in:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Specialised terminology","diplomatic context","interpretation","cultural intelligence","translation QA","AI evaluation","confidentiality"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"A particularly strong future profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Foreign Language","Diplomacy","Interpretation","Translation Technology","AI/LLM Evaluation","International Affairs"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This can create opportunities not only in embassies, but also in international organisations, multinational companies, diplomatic conferences, global consulting, localisation, international media and multilingual AI."}]}]}